          "text": "-    Viral URI / rhinosinusitis supportive care: PO decongestants (pseudoephedrine); topical nasal vasoconstrictors (phenylephrine, oxymetazoline)"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
